# Intergrax — Iteration Instruction

Implement **Intergrax Harness AI / Agent OS**. Root `AGENTS.md` = stub (~350 tok). Full reference: `@docs/guides/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md`. Symbol lookup: `@docs/guides/SYMBOL_INDEX.md`.

## F3 — session

```text
ONE DOMAIN = ONE NEW CHAT
```

Audit / implement / closeout: one domain pair per chat. Resume: new chat + bootstrap + `RESUME: docs/audit_results/…/progress.json` only.

## Context budget

- **Read:** arch hub read-scope block + plan hub read-scope + **one** satellite (`docs/plan/satellites/` or `docs/architecture/satellites/`).
- **Audits:** `docs/guides/audit_slices/<DOMAIN>.md` — not full IDEAL/AUDIT_MAP.
- **Max:** one file >5k tok per session unless RESUME cites more. Grep with path filter before semantic search.
- **Never** load `docs/audit_results/` unless RESUME. Respect `.cursorignore`.

## Never violate

```text
Tier-0 intergrax/ · Tier-1 runtime/ · Tier-2 agents/ · Tier-3 applications/
intergrax/ ↛ agents/|applications/   agents/ ↛ applications/
```

Default scope: gate maintenance `docs/plan/PLATFORM_FOUNDATION.md` hub. Phase K / §6.3 only with explicit operator approval.

**Mode I:** `audyt pomysłu` / `idea audit` → `intergrax-idea-audit.mdc` (no code until approved).

Repository artifacts: English. Operator chat: session language. **Do not commit** unless asked.

## O1 — output (terse default)

**Default: terse** — outcome, changed paths, tests pass/fail, blockers; **no** diff recap, long tables, or doc canon restatement.

| Mode | Trigger |
|------|---------|
| Minimal | `krótko` / `terse` → ≤6 lines |
| Terse | default implement/fix/gate → ≤12 lines |
| Full | `pełny raport` / `full report` / `iteration summary` / milestone·closeout·journal |

Full 12-point template: `@docs/guides/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` § Operator communication (load only when Full).

Verification / ADR / routing: `@docs/guides/AGENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` when needed.
